<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schroder raises two broadcasters.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schroder raises two broadcasters.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it upgraded BHC Communications Inc and Chris-Craft Industries Inc to outperform from perform in line.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- BHC shares rose 1/8 to 106-7/8. Chris-Craft fell 1/4 to 42.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
